        <detaileddescription>
<para>Destructor: ensures connection is released.</para>
<para>RAII: Cleanup guaranteed on scope exit, even if exception thrown.</para>
<para>THREAD-SAFETY: If the connection needs to be released by a specific thread (e.g., the I/O thread that acquired it), ensure the guard is destroyed on that thread. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
